ame><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Klee</surname><given-names>S.K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Evangelista</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Boone</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Pellman</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Control of mitotic spindle position by the <italic>Saccharomyces cerevisiae</italic> formin Bni1p</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>144</volume><year>1999</year><fpage>947</fpage><lpage>961</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10085293</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="LewandReed1993"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lew</surname><given-names>D.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Reed</surname><given-names>S.I.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Morphogenesis in the yeast cell cycleregulation by Cdc28 and cyclins</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>120</volume><year>1993</year><fpage>1305</fpage><lpage>1320</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8449978</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Lewetal1997"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lew</surname><given-names>D.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Weinert</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Pringle</surname><given-names>J.R.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cell cycle control in <italic>Saccharomyces cerevisiae</italic></article-title><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Pringle</surname><given-names>J.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Broach</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name></person-group><source>The Molecular and Cellular Biology of the Yeast Saccharomyces</source><year>1997</year><fpage>607</fpage><lpage>695</lpage><publisher-name>Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory Pre